WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Reconstruction using the old code. The original failed trial was not recorded.

00:06.000 --> 00:16.000
Depth stream cut after takeoff. Without a watchdog, the old planner continues flying.

00:16.000 --> 00:31.000
The aircraft reaches the box and collides; its path continues beyond the obstacle.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.100
ArduPilot's crash check disarms the aircraft. Event times are approximate.
